mments":7,"created_at":"2025-08-12T13:00:00Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T20:51:33Z","closed_at":"2025-11-27T20:51:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGODOT 4.4.1\n\n<img width=\"836\" height=\"956\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a0a64d3-6bd7-4642-a6f6-4a45f282c69a\" />\n\n<img width=\"836\" height=\"956\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c806f1e-895f-4945-94bf-2ed59135be9a\" />\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 22.04, X11 , Godot 4.4.1\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the Visual Shader editor, when a ParameterRef node is connected to a Parameter node, the texture displays correctly. However, if a Reroute node is added after the ParameterRef, the texture preview disappears (shows as blank/white).\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n    Create a Visual Shader.\n\n    Add a Parameter node for a texture.\n\n    Add a ParameterRef node linked to that Parameter.\n\n    Connect ParameterRef to the shader graph — the texture displays fine.\n\n    Insert a Reroute node between ParameterRef and the next node.\n\n    The texture disappears from the preview.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n<img width=\"836\" height=\"956\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2dd0d25-ad31-433c-86e2-b3795aa407e1\" />\n\n<img width=\"836\" height=\"956\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7a9082e-1c34-4749-b3b7-7b008f81f179\" />","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","fo